# The config of each sshd of the end-to-end test of nodkey. The
# entrypoint gives each sshd its own port and its own host key. The
# authorized_keys of each user is a file of root, so that the entrypoint
# needs no capability to write it.
AuthorizedKeysFile /etc/ssh/authorized_keys/%u
AllowUsers deploy ops
PermitRootLogin no
UsePAM no
PubkeyAuthentication yes
PasswordAuthentication no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
StrictModes yes
DisableForwarding yes
PermitTTY no
PrintMotd no
PidFile none
LogLevel VERBOSE
